{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00606","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 大明舞 · 魏徵、褚亮","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 大明舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五纪更运，三正递升。\n勋华既没，禹汤勃兴。\n神武命代，灵睠是膺。\n望云彰德，察纬告徵。\n上纽天维，下安地轴。\n徵师涿野，万国咸服。\n偃伯灵台，九官允穆。\n殊域委賮，怀生介福。\n大礼既饰，大乐已和。\n黑章扰囿，赤字浮河。\n功宣载籍，德被咏歌。\n克昌厥後，百禄是荷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵、褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}